      "title": "Security suspension overrides all issuance",
      "description": "A device that has not checked in for 30+ days is suspended from network access; no further equipment is issued to that colleague until resolved, overriding every other provision including 9.1 (16.2, Appendix A.4).",
      "rule_type": "prohibition",
      "authority": {
        "level": "corporate-security",
        "owner": "information-security",
        "rank": 30
